The '''Great Alliance''' was a military alliance between [[Holaria]], [[Prugundy]], [[Riuden]] and [[Zandomia]]. These allies, particularly during the [[Boreal War]], opposed those of the [[Nagur Pact]] ([[Astamon]], [[Qym]] and [[Thyon]]). 

When Holaria decided to start a war against the Nagur Pact by invading [[Tamodia]], the two [[Daroch]]ian powers of [[Riuden]] and [[Zandomia]] immediately offered their support, seeing an opportunity to simultaneously attack a less-protected [[Astamon]], as Qym and Thyon would be forced to primarily fight in Meran. [[Prugundy]] was initially reluctant in joining the war, as Holaria was the aggressor, until a change in government to a pro-war president galvanized popular support through the concept of [[wikipedia:revanchism|revanchism]] against Qym. 

